+   * `currentPrice * quantity` (CurrentPrice/"Now") and `listPrice * quantity` (ListPrice/"Was",
+   * only when `listPrice` is truthy) are multiplied by whatever `quantity` this file's own
+   * `<DisplayPrice quantity={variant?.quantity} .../>` call passes through.
+   *
+   * DISCLOSED LIMITATION, verified directly against the real (unmodified, copy-first-ported)
